WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.460
- Well, congratulations
Ilana, on your baby news.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.610
So who had the best reaction
to the news in your family?

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.443
(crowd clapping)

00:00:07.443 --> 00:00:10.160
- Oh my God. I am truly
are ready to proclaim

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.260
just thinking about
telling you about this.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:16.580
But my brother, my brother's
like, I don't know.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:20.870
I mean, he's sensitive, but
not always so emotional.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.630
But when we told him, oh!

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.017
When we told him he was like,

00:00:26.017 --> 00:00:27.217
"Wait? What? Oh my God!"

00:00:27.217 --> 00:00:29.887
And he just burst into tears.

00:00:29.887 --> 00:00:33.910
My husband and I just
made an Eliot sandwich.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:35.280
We just took him in our arms.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.990
It was, I'll never, I'll
never forget that reaction.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:40.589
What a beautiful reaction. Oh my gosh.

00:00:40.589 --> 00:00:43.170
Do you, remember Howie, whenever

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.640
your wife told you she was pregnant?

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.410
- I remember not the reaction

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:48.243
with my daughter,

00:00:48.243 --> 00:00:50.010
with my daughter who you met has two kids.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.240
But when she told us she was pregnant,

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.240
I was really excited.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:56.120
But the most exciting
moment is when we found out,

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.730
and this is just two months ago,

00:00:57.730 --> 00:00:58.902
who the father is.

00:00:58.902 --> 00:01:03.902
(crowd laughing)

00:01:05.048 --> 00:01:05.881
- [Kelly] Oh my God!

